OL,3,GNEWSAMain road closed after crash near
OL,4,Areservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the major road in the Peak
OL,7,FDistrict has been closed following a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said at about 16:50
OL,11,FBST on Sunday that the A628 Woodhead
OL,12,FPass was shut in both directions while
OL,13,Femergency services responded to the
OL,14,Fcrash.
OL,16,FIt happened alongside Torside
OL,17,FReservoir, near Crowden, the force
OL,18,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
